  "question": "What fast food restaurant exist within 190 kilometers as I proceed toward Blount-Bridgers House, Tarboro, NC from Curtis Motel, Bridgeton, NC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.017685 35.11729)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.537112 35.903658)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.017685 35.11729)',4326)::geography, 190000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.017685 35.11729)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
